    "prerequisites": "Level 10, Tomb Slam",
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>CURSE DISEASE SOUL UNLIVING-MUMMY</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 10, Tomb Slam</p>\n<p>The curse preserving you can pass into those shattered by your embalmed fists.</p>\n<p>When you inflict a critical injury with your Slam, the target must attempt a Fortitude save against Mummy Rot. The disease level is equal to your level. Stage 1: carrier with no visible effect for 1 minute. Stage 2: 4d6 essence damage and Injured 1 for 1 day. Damage inflicted by Mummy Rot cannot be healed until the curse is removed and the disease is cured. A creature can be exposed to your Mummy Rot only once per day.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a critical injury with Tomb Slam exposes the target to Mummy Rot at your level (its own Fortitude exposure save), once a day per creature.</p>",
